{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261121/photo/bkn-20261121074224038-1121_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261121095653\"/><p>尼籍漢倒斃南昌街公廁。</p><p>今日(21日)早上7時33分，深水埗南昌街公廁職員報案，指懷疑一名男子在上址暈倒。人員接報到場，消防破門而入，男子現場被證實死亡，36歲尼泊爾籍事主死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T03:03:58.452749+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T23:42:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T02:57:33.932977+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T02:57:33.932977+00:00","content_hash":"751f81ae377ab8ff2593003a22d885da02ea64909d04c1cb25d7055b0300737e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}